1
00:00:00,848 --> 00:00:04,018
(Sheldon:)And apparently Wil wheaton's
best friend.

2
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:07,105
(Scene:)- Sheldon.
- Talk to the hand.

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:13,030
(Raj:)Does anyone have any words they'd like
to say about our man of the evening?

4
00:00:13,194 --> 00:00:14,444
l do.

5
00:00:16,239 --> 00:00:21,619
As is the tradition, l've prepared a series of
disrespectful jokes which generate humor...

6
00:00:21,786 --> 00:00:24,786
(Sheldon:)...at Howard's expense.
Prepare to have your ribs tickled.

7
00:00:26,207 --> 00:00:31,127
(Sheldon:)Howard, I always thought you'd be
the last one of us to ever get married...

8
00:00:31,295 --> 00:00:34,465
(Sheldon:)...because you are so short
and unappealing, am I right?

9
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:38,137
(Sheldon:)Let's see here. Oh, seriously, though...

10
00:00:38,302 --> 00:00:42,432
(Sheldon:)Howard, you're actually one of
the most intelligent people I know.

11
00:00:42,598 --> 00:00:45,188
(Sheldon:)And that's a zinger because you're not.

12
00:00:47,186 --> 00:00:51,186
l've always thought that you'd make
someone a fine husband someday.

13
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,569
Assuming you'd get the parts
and develop the engineering skills...

14
00:00:54,735 --> 00:00:59,025
(Sheldon:)...to assemble them,
which I don't see as likely. Hot-cha!

